{"updated":"2026-10-06T23:09:54.425Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Privacy regulator launches probe into China-based company behind Kmart ‘pervert glasses’ app. Elsewhere, sarah Macdonald returns to ABC radio after being sacked in 2024. And trump says he will speak to Putin over reported plague death in Russia. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 4.1 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 43 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.9 near 264 km SSW of Severo-Kuril’sk, Russia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.2,0.23,0.28,0.33,0.36,0.4,0.44,0.49,0.51,0.55,0.58,0.6,0.65,0.78,0.89,1.07,1.39,1.51,1.56,1.59,1.61,1.66,1.68,1.71,1.73,1.79,1.83,1.93,1.99,2.03,2.07,2.1,2.16,2.19,2.22,2.29,2.33,2.38,2.42,2.47,2.52,2.57,2.61,2.66,2.72,2.77,2.84,2.96,3.03,3.16,3.19,3.24,3.27,3.33,3.38,3.44,3.55,3.65,3.7,3.79,3.84,3.89,3.94,3.99,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.14,4.17,4.19,4.21,4.26,4.31,4.39,4.45,4.52,4.59,4.64,4.7,4.74,4.79,4.82,4.88,4.99,5.14,5.32,5.83,5.91,5.96,6.01,6.06,6.12,6.2,6.29,6.37,6.42,6.5,6.57,6.64,6.71,6.79,6.86,6.92,6.95,7.04,7.08,7.14,7.19,7.25,7.3,7.35,7.43,7.48,7.55,7.61,7.7,7.83,7.88,7.93,7.98,8.01,8.07,8.12,8.15,8.22,8.27,8.34,8.41,8.47,8.53,8.59,8.64,8.73,8.8,8.85,8.87,8.93,8.96,9.03,9.09,9.15,9.21,9.25,9.37,9.58,9.64,9.71,9.76,9.83,9.9,9.95,10.04,10.13,10.29,10.38,10.44,10.53,10.55,10.59,10.65,10.74,10.8,10.87,10.93,10.98,11.05,11.11,11.16,11.21,11.3,11.35,11.41,11.51,11.54,11.59,11.63,11.78,11.82,11.89,12.06,12.76,12.85,12.92,12.98,13.03,13.07,13.13,13.17,13.22,13.3,13.34,13.47,13.54,13.65,13.72,13.75,13.79,13.82,13.85,13.9